    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Isaiah 40:28 — “The Lord is the everlasting God, the Creator of the ends of the earth.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Romans 1:25 — “Worshipped and served the creature rather than the Creator, who is blessed forever.”",
    "GREEK": "Κτίστης",
